(Svay Rieng): Speaking at the meeting to review the work results for February and March 2022 of the Svay Rieng Provincial Administration this morning, February 24, 2022, Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng and Chairman of the Provincial Administrative Unity Command. Instructed all relevant authorities to work together to prevent tax evasion and support the customs unit to collect taxes for the state.
At the same time, Mr. Men Vibol also instructed the relevant authorities to strive to effectively implement six guidelines, including:
* First: Continue to pay attention to maintaining security, social order and safety in the province better.
* Second, all municipal and district administrations must continue to work hard to solve problems that occur within their jurisdiction as much as possible and effectively for the local people, especially to strengthen the management and protection of state land and fodder. Lakes, rivers, canals for the benefit of the public.
* Third: Municipal and district authorities must disseminate and make vaccination statistics to local people of all ages to receive the vaccine in accordance with the regulations of the Ministry of Health.
* Fifth: Municipal and district authorities must participate in educating people to be careful about fires caused by electricity, incense and so on.
* Sixth, the relevant authorities must work hard to determine the work of rivers, streams, canals, lakes and reservoirs in the province according to each step after the first meeting of the management committee of this pool. Ago.
