Mr. Yang Sem said this on February 23, 2022 and met with district authorities, six commune councils in Chey Sen district, Preah Vihear province at the meeting hall of Chey Sen district hall, Preah Vihear province, with the participation of Ms. Khuon. Khun Dy, Senator, Ms. Chak Heng, Senator, District Authority and more than 60 commune councilors.
On behalf of the Senate from the 8th Zone, Mr. Yang Sem expressed his appreciation to all the district authorities and commune councils for their hard work in fulfilling their duties and responsibilities to serve the people and local development.
Mr. Yang Sem emphasized that all sub-national authorities, as frontline servants at the local level, must strive to increase their capacity, have a dignified and clean attitude, respect the law and not discriminate, and strive to solve people's problems in order to gain respect. Love and trust from the people, especially trying to resolve disputes outside the court system a lot.
He instructed the competent authorities and the people to take care of the newly built achievements in the commune and continue to work together to maintain peace, order and prevent other crimes, especially to prevent drug crimes, gangs, gambling. And abusive acts by supporting and promoting the implementation of the "Safe Village-Commune Policy" to run more smoothly and effectively.
In addition, to help mobilize local people to participate in the prevention, prevention and vaccination of Kovid 19 and maintain Khmer identity cards, identification documents to serve the election, civil status documents, educate children to study hard to live away from Drugs.
In addition to meeting with the Commune Council, a group of senators from the 8th Zone brought gifts of food and some suffixes to the monks in Wat Preah Indrong, and also brought the precious gift of Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate. To 3 needy families from Saang commune and 3 families from Tousa commune, Chey Sen district, Preah Vihear province, each family received 1 kit and some money.
