HE Vong Soth Sends Condolences on the Death of General Sok Saroeun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense
(Phnom Penh): His Excellency Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, on February 24, 2022, sent a message of condolences to General Sok Saroeun, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, who passed away at 10:45. This morning, February 23, 2022, at the age of 79, due to illness.
His Excellency Vong Soth expressed his regret for not being able to compare with the news of the death of General Sok Saroeun.
