(Phnom Penh): The basic vaccination of Kovid-19 vaccine for children from 3 to under 5 years old in Phnom Penh has started this morning, February 23, 2022, with the guardians, parents and grandparents. Grandfathers bring their children to be vaccinated against the large dose of Kovid-19 vaccine in large numbers at locations set up by Phnom Penh authorities.
Mr. THEM Sam An, Governor of Boeung Keng Kang District, inspected the vaccination site of Tuol Svay Prey Health Center in Sangkat Tuol Svay Prey II, Khan Boeung Keng Kang for children from 3 to 5 years old and visited the Vaccination Coordination Team and People who come to be vaccinated against Kovid-19.
At Chbar Ampov Referral Hospital, Chaktomuk Referral Hospital, Dangkor Referral Hospital, Pochentong Referral Hospital and some other referral hospitals, Kovid-19 vaccine is given to children from 3 years old to under 5 years old. This worked simultaneously with many of the children receiving the vaccine as well.
