Senior Minister Ly Thuch expressed his gratitude and appreciation for the generosity of Tycoon Van Sou Ieng in joining the Royal Government of Cambodia in raising awareness about mines and reducing the risk of landmines and unexploded ordnance. Cambodia.
He added that Choam Ksan district has the highest accident rate in Preah Vihear province, with a total of 1,318 victims of landmines and explosive remnants of war, of which 1,042 were mines, equivalent to 44% of the victims in Preah Vihear province. With 2995 victims.
