General Department of Taxation inaugurates office building and archives to keep taxpayer documents safe
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Kong Vibol, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Director General of the General Department of Taxation, presided over the inauguration ceremony of the office building and archives of the General Department of Taxation on the evening of February 22, 2022. On Victory Blvd. and the participation of leaders and officials at all levels of the General Department of Taxation.
Speaking on that occasion, Mr. Kong Vibol claimed that the construction of office buildings and archives of the General Department of Taxation was aimed at strengthening the management and storage of taxpayers' documents safely and orderly to avoid damage or loss of documents. This is important information for taxpayers, on the other hand, to expand the file storage space, which can respond to the situation of increasing taxpayer growth from year to year.
It should also be noted that the archives of the General Department of Taxation were inaugurated on February 27, 2021, after receiving the high approval of Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance. The construction was completed on February 22, 2022, which took 11 months and 25 days.
The office building and archives of the General Department of Taxation are located on Lot No. 6121, Chan Chhnang Blvd., Phlou Paem Village, Sangkat Kork Roka, Khan Prek Pnov, Phnom Penh. Divided into 3 buildings, including:
* Building A is 32 meters long x 40 meters, equivalent to 1,353 square meters, a modern concrete structure focused on safety and adequate ventilation. The building has two parts, one for office work and the other for storing taxpayer documents. The building has two special designs: the upper part is a roof in the form of a file box cover and the lower part is a file storage and works in the form of a file box.
Building B and Building C are 30 meters long x 40 meters, equal to the size of 1.581 square meters, the same as the construction of the steel frame warehouse, which is the latest modern construction technique used to store various equipment and to meet the work requirements of the General Department. Taxes. Do not drive at the speed limit! 7 killed and 11 injured in traffic accidents nationwide on February 22 yesterday
