Ali Akbar Nazari also agreed with the Cambodian side on the signing of a memorandum of understanding on tourism cooperation between the two countries, which was initiated by Cambodia and has already proposed to the Iranian side. The two sides will arrange for the signing of a memorandum on tourism and at the same time a memorandum on sports.
Minister Thong Khon also invited the Minister of Tourism and Heritage of Iran to visit Cambodia, and the Ambassador of Iran also invited Minister Thong Khon to visit Iran to sign the Memorandum of Understanding on Tourism.
