The success of the Beijing Winter Olympics highlights the global solidarity for a common future
BEIJING, Feb. 20 (Xinhua) - The Beijing Winter Olympics closed successfully on the night of Feb. 20 after a tumultuous atmosphere of joy and sadness erupted in the hearts of all athletes who took part in the event. This.
In traditional Chinese culture, "Chinese unity" represents unity, happiness and peace. A string or ribbon can be folded into a small bond, as if each country is a separate character, but if these strings or ribbons are combined, it will form a large and strong bond, which is a strong force of unity. Overcome all obstacles and solve all problems.
Speaking at the closing ceremony, Thomas Bach, President of the International Olympic Committee, said that China has hosted a safe and wonderful Winter Olympics, an unparalleled Winter Olympics. Compatible. Athletes from other countries also highlight the Olympic spirit through their professional ethics, especially the most valuable solidarity.
As China highlighted at the end of the closing ceremony, the fireworks exploded into a brightly colored veil over the night sky, especially the Chinese and English fireworks. "He is one great family," showing the world China's strong will to join hands with the world to build a community of common destiny for humanity and for the future.
