On that occasion, Ms. Seng Vuoch Hun emphasized that, therefore, the Cambodian Intellectual Property Association really needs other relevant ministries and institutions that are close partners to work together to ensure that the Cambodian intellectual property sector is disseminated to the public. People, both inside and outside the country, to participate in promoting Cambodia's intellectual property sector as well as the national economy to be even more prosperous.
The Cambodian Intellectual Property Association and the Anti-Counterfeiting Committee are both in need of a mutual understanding to make their work more effective.
The Royal Government of Cambodia has also dedicated all its time, energy and time to the fight against counterfeit products and intellectual property infringement to ensure the safety and trust of our business owners and citizens. Counterfeit products, infringement of intellectual property, and spoiled food containing chemicals, such as food, are causing serious damage to the health, life and socio-economy of Cambodia.
