Why foreign investors are happy to invest in China is because the Chinese market can bring them good returns. In the context of the severe spread of Kovid 19 virus, foreign direct investment in the world is still weak, but in China, foreign enterprises are increasing their investment as a result of the prevention and control of Kovid 19 virus. Effectively and also proves the attractiveness of a huge market.
For foreign-invested enterprises, the focus is on the continued growth potential of China's major markets. Such a huge potential market makes foreign capital full of confidence. New enterprises entering the Chinese market are expected to do business with stability, while "old friends" who have been investing in China for many years have expressed a desire to continue doing business.
Another reason why foreign investors are optimistic about the Chinese market is that the "soft environment" of Chinese investment is steadily improving. China has taken a number of measures to expand openness and improve the business environment in order to make Chinese multinational enterprises more trustworthy.
According to the "Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement" entered into force on January 1 this year, in the future, regional economic cooperation will create more investment opportunities in China. More and more. Speaking of the global economy, which has been recovering weakly, this is also a very valuable opportunity.
Looking to the future, China will continue to unleash greater growth potential, continue to expand its openness to foreign countries and create a business environment that is market-oriented, legalized and globalized, as well as share more quality economic development benefits with the world. Mr. It is estimated that there will be more and more multinational enterprises, realizing that investment in China will have more and bigger opportunities. (#CCFR Comment #)
