Meak Bochea is considered to be a big religious festival, always held at the pagoda every year, never to be missed. By maintaining and adhering to these traditions, the officials, monks and Buddhists are sincere and sincere in the field of Buddhism, so this year at Wat Keo Vichey united to celebrate Meak Bochea by following Rule "3 protection and 3 do not" of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
