Oknha Kith Meng's encouragement was made during the participation and welcome speech at the first Cambodia-Hungary Business Meeting online under the theme "Cambodia-Hungary Business Connectivity: Tips for Promoting Sustainability" Economic Partners for Economic Recovery Resistant to Global Epidemic Crisis Kovid-19 "on the afternoon of February 15, 2022.
The business meeting was chaired by Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce of Cambodia and was attended by about 70 senior officials, investors and businessmen.
Duke Kith Meng thanked the leadership of the Ministry of Commerce of Cambodia and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Trade of Hungary for organizing this important business meeting to contribute to strengthening cooperation between the two countries. Key potential areas include: agriculture and agro-industry, irrigation and industry, environment, food safety, tourism services, medical and pharmaceutical technology, and garment and garment manufacturing.
