Dr. Kao Thach added that in 2022, the fund will be used for the following purposes: $ 10 million in rice financing, $ 20 million in direct financing and $ 20 million in risk-sharing co-financing. Dollars.
For SME Bank, an additional $ 50 million will be used to continue the second phase of the co-financing project to support small and medium enterprises, bringing the Royal Government's contribution to $ 120 million.
