However, the White House declined to comment on the invitation. CNN quoted a Ukrainian official as saying on condition of anonymity that Ukraine had not received a positive response from Joe Biden.
The former Ukrainian president has also expressed frustration over the poor assessment of the possibility of a war between Ukraine and Russia, saying such warnings have hurt the country's economy and added to pressure on the national currency. Ukraine.
