According to instructions from Fresh News, the Ministry of Education has observed that some students mistakenly think that February 14 is Valentine's Day or a date between couples. This day is not a tradition of our Cambodian people. A small number of young people have acted foolishly, forgot their studies, lost their dignity, and their families, leaving Khmer culture and traditions.
In order to continue to strengthen the implementation of internal regulations in educational institutions and to continue to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports would like to introduce the following measures to prevent abnormal activities on Valentine's Day 14 February 2022 as follows: :
1. All stakeholders must disseminate to students by all means so as not to misunderstand the meaning of Valentine's Day.
2. All educational institutions and classrooms must strictly enforce discipline, especially on ethical management, by regularly monitoring the absence of students.
