Samdech Techo led a high-level delegation to visit South Korea and co-chair the 2022 World Peace Summit under the theme "Towards Peace on the Korean Peninsula."
According to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and his delegation will visit South Korea until February 13 before returning to Cambodia.
