Former CNRP member of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Council and his wife join the political life with the CPP
(Banteay Meanchey): Rin Rey, a former member of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Council of the former National Rescue Party (CNRP), and his wife decided to join politics with the CPP after they clearly understood the values and advantages of the ruling party. This one for the motherland and the people of Cambodia.
The handing over ceremony of CPP decision and card to Mr. Rin Rey and his wife was held on Thursday afternoon, February 10, 2022 at the CPP office in Banteay Meanchey province, presided over by Mr. Oum Rath, President of the Cambodian People's Party. Banteay Meanchey province, with the participation of Mr. You Sereyvuth and other working groups of the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Oum Rath, as well as Mr. You Serey Vuth, warmly welcomed and considered that Rin Rey and his wife's participation in the political life was the right decision to unite with the Cambodian People's Party, which was chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen. Building and developing a more prosperous Cambodian society as well as bringing harmony, prosperity and prestige to the nation and its people.
Rin Rey is a former CNRP councilor and executive member of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Executive Committee. Rin Ry is an active leader of the former CNRP in Banteay Meanchey province.
Mr. Rin Rey claimed that his participation in the political life with the Cambodian People's Party because he clearly saw the policy in leading the country of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party makes Cambodia prosperous. And development in all areas. In particular, Cambodians live under the roof of peace, tranquility and happiness.
Mr. Rin Ry emphasized, "Seeing the great merits of Samdech Techo to the nation and the people, I swear to be loyal to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Cambodian People's Party. "Especially committed to supporting His Excellency Dr. Hun Manet as the candidate for Prime Minister in the future and for life."
With the demonstration of the values and advantages of the Cambodian People's Party, Mr. Rin Rey also mentioned some of the disadvantages of the former CNRP, which made him dissatisfied and broke up with the former party leader. Against this one, too.
Rin Rey attacked the former CNRP leader for doing politics without a clear policy on nation building. In addition, they used populist politics to incite anger and hatred in Cambodian society, which led to national division and national catastrophe as in the past.
Mr. Rin Rey expressed his deep gratitude to the President of the Cambodian People's Party, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, for allowing him and his wife to live with the Cambodian People's Party. Mr. Rin Rey also thanked Dr. Hun Manet, Member of the Standing Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, for facilitating his participation with the Cambodian People's Party.
