(Phnom Penh): Neak Oknha Kith Meng, President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, on February 9, 2022, received Mr. Seang Sopanha, President of the Cambodian Young Entrepreneurs Association, for a courtesy call and discussion at the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce.
