According to FUNCINPEC's political strategy, it still adheres to the policy of neutrality, independence, sovereignty and non-alignment, and under the leadership of the new party president, the party has pledged to reform its internal affairs to How to become a strong force to cooperate with the ruling party to build a stronger nation.
