(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on February 9, 2022, sent a congratulatory message to Dr. Hak Jahan Moon, Founder of the Global Peace Federation, on her birthday. At the same time, Samdech also thanked Ms. Bandit and the Sun Hak Peace Award Committee for selecting Samdech as the winner of the Sun Hak Peace Award 2022. This is according to the letter from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which was received by Fresh News.
