Official: The implementation of the Cambodian Sustainable Landscape and Ecotourism Sustainability Project for 6 years expects better natural resource management
(Phnom Penh): "In the implementation of the Sustainable Landscape and Sustainable Tourism Project of Cambodia for 6 years 2020-2025), it is expected that the management of natural resources will be better through us implementing the law enforcement plan, we plant, rehabilitate, we protect" . This is according to Mr. Khin Meng Kheang, Director of the Department of Ecotourism of the General Department of Local Communities, Ministry of Environment.
