The Ministry of Planning discusses the planning of policy-related activities between the General Secretariat of Population and Development and the Provincial Planning Department in Stung Treng Province
(Stung Treng): The Ministry of Planning, in cooperation with Stung Treng Provincial Administration, this morning, February 8, 2022, organized a workshop on the planning of policy-related activities between the General Secretariat of Population and Development and the Capital-Provincial Planning Department. Mr. Poch Bunnak, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Planning.
Mr. Poch Bunnak stated that the main purpose of this workshop was to review and discuss the report on the work results in 2021 and work activities in 2022 and to monitor and evaluate the implementation of the National Population Policy 2016-2030 of the Office of the People and Development of Capital-Provincial Departments.
He also stated that the purpose of this training is to further strengthen the capacity of sub-national officials to gain an in-depth understanding of the National Population Policy 2016-2030 and to develop demographic indicators, analyze graphics and Interpret data for inclusion in the capital-provincial development strategic plan and to collect relevant data from the inter-sectoral to produce demographic reports in each province.
