The meeting was held on 07-08 February 2022, chaired by Lt. Gen. Lay Chenda, Deputy Director General of the General Department of Politics and Foreign Affairs and chaired by the ASEAN Senior Defense Minister Working Group of Cambodia to discuss key documents for ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting 2022 under the theme "Solidarity for Security and Harmony".
