Meanwhile, the meeting discussed in detail and agreed on the contents of 1: Joint Declaration of the ASEAN Defense Ministers 'Meeting and 2: Joint Declaration of the ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting, both of which will be approved by the meeting. ASEAN Defense Minister as well.
As the chair of the ASEAN Defense Ministers's Working Group, the General Department of Politics and Foreign Affairs of the Ministry of National Defense will hold another ASEAN Senior Defense Ministers' Working Group Meeting in the form of a Videoconference in March 2022 for a full discussion. The remaining documents, including two discussion papers initiated by Cambodia.
