The former FUNCINPEC Vice President added: "In order to pay tribute to the noble merits of Norodom Ranariddh, the historical leader of FUNCINPEC, I and my family and supporters have decided to pay tribute. "Support for Prince Norodom Chakravuth, President of the party, who submitted to the Congress to vote of confidence on February 9, 2022."
Nheun Raden, spokesman for FUNCINPEC, added: "Prince Norodom Chakravuth has received the right of Samdech Krom Preah to lead and the party will inform the decision later."
