Poipet Military sends suspect to court over drug trafficking case
(Banteay Meanchey): Brigadier General Nuon Ninaro, Commander of the Poipet City Gendarmerie, said that his forces had arrested a 30-year-old male suspect, Hay Songtra, after receiving information from nearby residents. Kob Thom Chattaly Center, located in Kob Thom Village, Sangkat Nimit, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province, said that the suspect was involved in drugs.
Colonel Nuon Ninaro further stated that after receiving the information, he immediately led the force to the scene and arrested the suspect at 20:30 on February 6, 2022. Confiscated exhibits include: 2 small bags of white gram powder weighing 1.55 grams and some other materials. The suspect, after being detained, was sent to the Municipal Gendarmerie Base for questioning.
The suspect, Hay Songtra, was staying in a rented room in Kbal Spean 1 Village, Sangkat Poipet, Poipet City, Banteay Meanchey Province. After questioning, the suspect confessed that he had actually bought drugs for his own use and for resale.
Based on the evidence and the confession of the suspect, the local specialized force of the Municipal Gendarmerie prepared a case file and sent it to the Provincial Gendarmerie Headquarters for further action.
Colonel Chea Dara, Deputy Commander of the Provincial Gendarmerie in charge of Anti-Drug Affairs, said that he reported the crackdown to Brigadier General Born Bin, Commander of the Provincial Gendarmerie under the coordination of the procedure. Born Vannareth, a prosecutor with the provincial court.
Currently, the suspect and the exhibits have been sent to the Provincial Court by the Provincial Anti-Drug Office of the Royal Gendarmerie.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Phay Siphan, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Spokesperson Unit of the Royal Government of Cambodia, stated that the presence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Chairman of ASEAN, will attend the ASEAN-US Summit with The upcoming US President is a source of pride for Cambodians everywhere, including those who oppose the monarchy, who often stand outside the White House.
On January 14, 2022, US President Joe Biden wrote a letter to Samdech Techo Hun Sen attending the ASEAN-US Summit in Washington, DC. In the letter, Mr. Biden stated that he was waiting to welcome Samdech to Washington.
In response to this invitation, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has already confirmed that he will go to Washington and meet with Mr. Biden in person there.
In a press conference on Tuesday morning, February 8, 2022, Mr. Phay Siphan described Samdech Techo Hun Sen's visit to Washington as a historic event for Cambodian leaders who have never been to the White House. Not so close to the United States. He considered Samdech Techo's trip to Washington a source of pride for Cambodians, including the opposition, who often stand outside the White House.
The Minister accompanying the Prime Minister added, "This is a great pride of Cambodia, the pride of the Cambodian people, and the evaluators despise it as a separate matter. But Samdech's presence at the White House is an honor for us Cambodians. ”
However, Phay Siphan could not confirm the exact time and agenda of the upcoming meeting between the ASEAN leaders and the US President. But Phay Siphan estimated that the agenda that could be discussed was to strengthen ASEAN-US relations and cooperation, as well as strengthen ASEAN's position on Indo-Pacific policy.
Chinese culture and Chinese romance reflected in Beijing Winter Olympics
BEIJING: As promised by China, the opening ceremony of the 2022 Beijing Winter Olympics was held on a regular basis under the auspices of many Chinese and foreign leaders as well as people around the world. Mr.
In traditional Chinese culture, spring is highly valued because as the beginning of the new year begins, the cold weather gradually drifts away and is replaced by the moderate coolness of spring. All the flowers start to sprout and grow, showing off their natural beauty.
The opening ceremony, in which green plants grow with a smile, is a sign of vitality, enthusiasm and prosperity, especially highlighting the concept of green development, which is the direction of sustainable development of the world now and in the future.
It should be recalled that the Chinese style, which is a representative of Chinese culture, has been fully integrated into the whole process of the Beijing Winter Olympics, from the time of preparation to the opening time and to the competition. The puppet competition symbols, designed in the form of pandas and lanterns, as well as the style of the venue, are the essence of traditional Chinese culture.
In addition to sharing its traditional culture to make the world more aware of China, China also hopes to unite with the world by launching a slogan on the theme of the Winter Olympics. This time it was "Together for the Future" that received widespread recognition and support from the international community.
In the context of Kovid-19, China has hosted world-class sports events that are great and safe, shedding light on the world's people's hopes for peace, friendship and solidarity. We can be confident that the organization of a great Olympic Games will contribute to a greater "Chinese strength" for building a community of common destiny for mankind.
