1. Systematic skills deficits among young people in Cambodia during the period of rapid technological change associated with access to secondary education remain low.
2: Inconsistency between the needs of the labor market and the skills of young people.
3: The need to strengthen the ecosystem of entrepreneurship and business as a source of employment and well-being
4: The need to address the increase of informal work, vulnerable work and lack of quality of work.
