(Kratie): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Mr. Wang Vinthean, Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia, co-chaired the inauguration ceremony of National Road No. 7 from the roundabout on the morning of February 7, 2022. Khla Stos, Kratie City, to Romat Village, O'Kreang Commune, Sambo District, Kratie Province, with a length of 93.56 kilometers, built with the assistance of the Chinese government more than 33 million US dollars.
On the occasion of the inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered the following two-hour speech as follows:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the 2003 political stalemate did not prevent Chinese aid to Cambodia, which was an expression of China's solidarity and approach to relations with Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the connection of infrastructure to the northeast, Samdech seems a bit biased with other provinces because China has helped build a lot of infrastructure in the northeastern provinces such as Kratie, Stung Treng, Ratanakkiri and Mondulkiri.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech wants to turn the northeastern province into Cambodia's fourth economic pole in terms of agriculture, industry and mineral resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he traveled about 6,000 kilometers across the country in 2016 in order to understand the situation of the country during the war and when there is no war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the gold produced in Mondulkiri province for the past 7 months has produced about 1,751 kg.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was really happy with the achievements that came from his drawing after the end of the war in late 1998.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that provinces across the country are already connected by road and bridge infrastructure, leaving only the northwest to the southwest.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the current situation in Cambodia is not the same as before, deploying roads and deploying health centers and schools.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that he plans to meet with all A-level students in Phnom Penh on February 28, 2022.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without access to clean water, no schools, no health centers, the poverty gap between urban and rural areas could not be reduced.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that he will provide electricity to all rural areas of Cambodia, while currently covering more than 98 percent.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in March, two large hospitals worth nearly $ 80 million with Chinese aid will be inaugurated. The two hospitals are: Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital, Tbong Khmum and Cambodia-China Friendship Hospital Preah Kosomak.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded his friends of China's duty to help build a bridge across the river in Kratie province and the road connecting Kratie to Kampong Thom.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that China has already examined the phytosanitary and hygienic procedures of Cambodia, which is a bigger market.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to respect traffic laws as traffic accidents kill people every day.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for 30 days, Cambodia has not had 19 deaths from Kovid, but must continue to pay attention to prevention and dose.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech did not act as a commander who allowed troops to enter the battlefield without equipment and weapons for battle. Doctors as well as Samdech should not lack medical equipment.
