(Phnom Penh): Mr. Khleang Huot, Chairman of the Committee of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Chroy Changvar District, instructed 217 newly-elected members of the Cambodian People's Party (CPP) to participate in safeguarding peace and the achievements of the society and to serve the interests of society. At the local level to gain the respect, love, satisfaction and support of the people.
This statement was made on the occasion of Mr. Khleang Huot announcing the inclusion of 217 new party members in the Koh Dach Sangkat Party to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party. The announcement ceremony was held on the morning of January 6, 2022 at the party office in Sangkat Koh Dach, Khan Chroy Changva, with the participation of party leaders, Khan, Sangkat and about 250 relevant members.
Mr. Sin Bona, former Chief of Koh Dach Commune and a former activist of the former National Rescue Party, a representative of the newly elected members, has now pledged to support the CPP, to vote for the CPP and to support Samdech Techo Hun Sen's candidacy. The next Prime Minister.
He added that today is the second announcement of membership, the first time has 27 members and the second time has 217 members, a total of 244 members. In addition to the already announced members of the Cambodian People's Party, there are hundreds of other members, the working group is preparing and will be announced in the near future.
Mr. Khleang Huot said that the Cambodian People's Party is the oldest political party, has experience in leading, has sufficient human resources, has a strong structure at all levels, especially with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the party president and prime minister. Trust by the people.
Mr. Khleang Huot continued that through the achievements of the party for the past 43 years, starting from the January 7 victory, the Cambodian People's Party has achieved unimaginable social change.
He said that Cambodia has turned from a killing field of genocidal regimes, from the battlefield of chronic war, from national disintegration and territorial division to a land of peace, unity, stability, freedom, democracy, rule of law and development. Sectors that enable all people to live in harmony under one roof of the same constitution.
He requested the new members of the Cambodian People's Party to participate in safeguarding peace, protecting the achievements of the society and participating in good activities to actively serve the social interests at the local level in order to gain respect, love, satisfaction and support. From the people.
Mr. Khleang Huot confirmed that the inclusion of this new member to strengthen and increase the preparation for the 5th Commune / Sangkat Council Election on June 5, 2022.
At the same time, Mr. Khleang Huot also donated 7,890,000 Riels for the ceremony and to the new members, including party shirts and hats.
