Prior to the new leadership, the Khmer National Unity Party had Neou Sam Ath as its chairman, Un Chim as its first vice president and Lak Sopheap as its second vice president. In the past, Ms. Lak Sopheap had accused Mr. Un Chim of plotting to overthrow the party.
