Letter to readers: Samdech Techo Hun Sen's iron fist is an iron fist of peace and tranquility for the motherland of Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): During the period from 1975 to 1979, Cambodia went through the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, which killed more than 3 million people, including the killing of Cambodian intellectuals, government officials, teachers and experts who are all resources At the heart of the development of the society were left widows, orphans and the disabled, as well as the ruins of infrastructure, food shortages and productivity.
Three years, eight months and 20 days of the genocidal regime of Pol Pot is a wallless prison where Cambodians have no hope of regaining their freedom, not even their hope of survival, and their right to life. Neither.
