Decapitated a monk in Sangkum Thmei district, Preah Vihear province after having sex with a minor until she became pregnant
(Preah Vihear): A monk living in a pagoda in Kampong Thom province was decapitated by the Sangkum Thmey sub-district in Preah Vihear province and handed over to the authorities to deal with according to the law after the story of comforting a minor girl to have sex until she became pregnant.
Vuth Savy, Deputy Prosecutor and Spokesman for the Preah Vihear Provincial Prosecutor's Office, told Fresh News this morning, February 4, 2022, that yesterday he led the provincial police. Detained a suspect (a monk) after the Sangkum Thmey sub-district decapitated in connection with the case of comforting a minor girl to have sex until she became pregnant.
Mr. Vuth Savy said that the suspect who was detained by the police was named Yun Sokhet, 21 years old, living in Ta Seng Cheung village, Ranasir commune, Sangkum Thmei district, Preah Vihear province. The victim was a 14-year-old girl named P.S.K.
He said that this case has occurred since April 2021, and the case was leaked after the girl was not feeling well. When the family went for an ultrasound, they found out that she was pregnant, while the suspect confessed and showed many places to the police that he and the girl had sex with each other.
According to the order of a monk, it was also revealed that this monk had been venerated at a pagoda in Sangkum Thmey district many times, which meant that he was vengeful. After the last time he saw an unusual activity, especially through the use of Facebook, the chief priest of the pagoda was not allowed to stay in this pagoda from July 2021, and he went to live in a pagoda in Kampong Thom province.
However, even though he lives in Kampong Thom province, he often visits his house and enters and leaves his pagoda normally.
