In addition to assuring that Cambodia is in the process of administering the fourth dose of vaccination to frontline civil servants, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also promoted the fourth dose vaccination campaign to civil servants, the armed forces and the people of Phnom Penh and beyond. Provinces whenever they have access to refrigeration equipment for proper storage of vaccines.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also instructed the Ministry of Health, relevant ministries and institutions in all capitals, provinces, municipalities, districts, communes, sangkats to continue to accelerate the vaccination of the third dose for all people.
The Prime Minister called on the people who have not been vaccinated to come and get vaccinated as soon as possible at the designated places to increase the demand in the community in response to the socio-economic reopening in New normal trajectory.
