Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Construction of the flyover on National Road 5 near Freedom Park
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of January 31, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, inaugurated the construction site of a new flyover in Phnom Penh to facilitate and relieve traffic congestion that is growing rapidly.
The newly opened flyover is located along National Road 5, the junction of the road connecting the Russey Keo cable-stayed bridge across the Tonle Sap River, which connects National Road 5 and the Chroy Changva satellite city. The flyover has a total length of 483 meters (the length of the flyover is 145 meters and the base of the bridge is 338 meters on each side), with a width of 15.8 meters. It is planned to spend nearly 10 million US dollars on construction.
During the opening ceremony, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than an hour with the following main contents:
* As a start, Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his feeling that he was really happy with the opening of the construction site of the flyover on National Road 5.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although there are no holidays in the calendar, there are definitely people who take holidays and travel during the Chinese New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the flyover on National Road 5 will significantly contribute to easing traffic congestion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Phnom Penh Capital Administration and OCIC of Oknha Pong Kheav Se for his development efforts in Chroy Changva.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia not only needs to connect within the framework of the country, but also to connect with foreign countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the current situation in Cambodia has ended the lives of many boat people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of the flyover in Phnom Penh used a strategy of packing palm leaves and packing sugar cane.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was proud and could not believe in the growth in Phnom Penh, even though he was the direct leader.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that he did not understand those who say that Cambodia is getting poorer, while in the past the Chroy Changva area was all Prey Treng, now all the buildings.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a society can not make life equal, but must strive to reduce poverty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that people's protests are not a determining factor in the peace of each country. Samdech Techo said that if only people protest and say that Cambodia is not peaceful, then in the United States protest and shoot each other almost every day?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is not able to bring peace of mind for everyone with different crises, but Samdech guarantees peace from war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the meaning of peace that Samdech Samdech refers to is peace without war or war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that those who complain about the rising oil price are still moaning, but still traveling. Samdech Techo stated that the increase in oil prices is a global factor.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the CPP and the Cambodian people will never forget the January 7 Victory Day. Despite the war to defend January 7, it must be done.
* Samdech Techo confirmed that not celebrating January 7 to send a message to the people to join the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen was outraged by the group of analysts who analyzed the story of Samdech bringing Dr. Hun Manet to the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Dr. Hun Manet worked hard to prevent 19 Kovids from invading the Royal Palace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when bringing Mr. Hun Manet to worship the King in the past to tell the King about the succession of Mr. Hun Manet after Samdech resigned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people who travel to respect traffic laws.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on the people to work together to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chinese government provided an additional 5 million doses of vaccine and ordered 3 million doses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that yesterday, Samdech met with the future Minister and Deputy Prime Minister of Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the new Kovid 19 virus "Omikrong" has spread to the districts that need to pay attention to fight and prevent infection.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party did not discriminate against the people, they can be clearly seen when vaccinating the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech put a lot of programs this week to prevent the Minister to travel far during the Chinese New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Phnom Penh has a lot of development, but without peace, this development can not be sustainable.
