Mr. Thong Khon and Governor of Kampong Thom Province Visit Kork Trabek Village, Taing Kork District to Solve Some Urgent Problems
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Chairman of the Royal Government Working Group visited Kampong Thom Province and Mr. Nguon Rattanak, Governor of Kampong Thom Province on January 30, 2022, led government officials, local authorities, law enforcement forces and relevant professional officers. Solve some problems for the people in Kork Trabek village, Sra Lao commune, Taing Kork district, Kampong Thom province.
After traveling more than 50 kilometers for more than 2 hours, the two leaders met and received greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany. Hun Sen to the people of Kork Trabek village, a remote village located in three areas around the Tonle Sap Lake in Kampong Thom province.
On that occasion, Mr. Nguon Rattanak stated that the base of Kork Trabek village has received one of the most special policies that the people have lived since before the Sangkum era, and that is why the Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen Considering the living conditions of the people in Kork Trabek village very much.
The provincial governor affirmed that the administration of Kampong Thom province will continue to strive to implement the policies of the Royal Government in the spirit of the National Assembly No. 1003 and No. 1044 to solve problems for the people so that the people can use and enjoy the location with the actual owner.
At the same time, Mr. Thong Khon encouraged the local people in Kork Trabek village to cooperate with the authorities and professional officials honestly so that the people's problems can be solved smoothly and correctly.
He also urged the people not to commit crimes such as deforestation, flooding, fishing offenses such as fishing to sustain the Tonle Sap Lake and future generations.
The Chairman of the Kampong Thom Provincial Government Working Group also urged people of voting age to check the voter list and prepare documents to prove their identity or Khmer identity card to participate in the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election. June 5, 2022 and the upcoming election.
Minister Thong Khon also urged the Taing Kork District Administration Authority and Sralao Commune Administration to jointly organize the beauty and order in the village and on the streets to be clean and green. Provide better public services to the people, such as services of Khmer identity card, health services, education services and so on.
Mr. Thong Khon, on behalf of the Chairman of the Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party to Assist Baray and Taing Kork Districts, also introduced Sralao Commune Council as well as Commune Council candidates who are ready to stand for the upcoming election, as well as to increase their attention. To help the people, especially to work with the authorities and professional officers who will come down to measure the land for the people in the near future.
Provincial Governor Nguon Rattanak also stated that the recommendation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen for Kampong Thom province is not only focused on Kork Trabek village, but also some other villages and communes with similar situation, such as Peam Bang commune of Stong district and commune. Phat Sanday of Kampong Svay district, etc., and the Royal Government will try to solve all local people.
