Twenty-six A-level students in Koh Thom district, Kandal province, received a motorcycle incentive from Senior Minister Sun Chanthol
(Kandal): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Chairman of the National Working Group of the Royal Government of Koh Thom District, on January 30, 2022, led a delegation to meet and award prizes to high school students in Koh Thom district who passed the exam. High school diploma (Bakdup) during the exam session on December 27, 2021.
Speaking on that occasion, the Senior Minister also expressed his pleasure and pride in the efforts of students, teachers and parents who have achieved this brilliant success, which is the result of hard work. Student learning A specific desire for learning, along with other motivations, leads to positive outcomes for all of these students.
The Senior Minister also encouraged the students who have just passed the high school diploma exam (Bakdup) during the exam session on December 27, 2021 to choose the major at the university they want to study according to what they want to study and their preferences. In particular, examine the labor market appropriately.
He would like to see all students in the future become the successors in building the quality of Cambodia's infrastructure in accordance with the slogan of Samdech Techo Prime Minister: Khmer can do it. On the other hand, he said that our ancestors were able to build hundreds of years old temples that are famous all over the world, such as: Angkor Wat, the temple of Preah Vihear, a world heritage site, and a stone bridge that is hundreds of years old, and so on. Must be done.
In addition, the Senior Minister also informed about the project to build a nine-storey Techo Sen Institute of Public Works and Transport building that can accommodate three to four thousand students to study at this institute and turn the existing institute building into Four-story building to accommodate homeless students living in Phnom Penh.
The Senior Minister also informed about the achievements and ongoing projects such as: Koh Thom District Swimming Stadium, Techo Sen Hospital Construction Project, Koh Thom District, Bassac River Crossing, Koh Thom District, Road, Bridge and many other achievements and called on students to help disseminate achievements. This to friends, relatives, as well as the public to understand the efforts of the Royal Government under the leadership of the Cambodian People's Party.
He added that according to the plan, Techo Sen Hospital in Koh Thom District is scheduled to be completed and officially inaugurated under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Prime Minister at the beginning of next year. The hospital will cooperate in technical and training with the department. Calmette Hospital to provide health care services to the residents of Koh Thom and other neighboring areas as well.
(Prey Veng): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Prey Veng and Battambang Provincial Party Working Group, stated that as a party youth, it is necessary to abide by the Constitution and abide by the implementation of the Constitution. The policy of the same party must be able to handle the changing situation related to its jurisdiction.
