Samdech continued that the promotion of pure patriotic ideals is the most important point of the youth, including the upholding of the national interest as a whole. Samdech added that as a youth, the party must abide by the Constitution, implement the party's policies, and at the same time be able to handle the changing situation related to its jurisdiction.
At the same time, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng continued that young people must be trained in both knowledge and morality. Samdech continued that learning in the sense for the party youth group is learning about people's lives in order to hone their ability to solve various challenges, including daring to overcome obstacles to have the opportunity to gain experience.
Before concluding, Samdech Krala Hom expressed his hope that the Provincial Party Youth Working Group will strive to achieve more new work progress related to the work of serving the nation and the people that the conference has set out.
