At the same time, Ms. Khuon Khun Dy said that all achievements do not happen by themselves, there must be unity. She also thanked the local authorities, philanthropists and people who have worked together to build a lot of achievements under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
She said that the Buddhist sector and the empire must rely on the factors of peace, political stability and social security, which are indispensable, in fact, the achievements worth tens of thousands of US dollars, which is now inaugurated.
