Understand business: This year, the tax will encourage enterprises in the field of business gambling (casino) to come to register taxes and pay taxes properly.
In addition to these important tasks, another priority task of the General Department of Taxation is to encourage enterprises in the field of commercial gambling (casino) to come in to register taxes and pay taxes properly. This is according to the press release on the results of tax revenue collection in 2021 and the direction for further implementation of the General Department of Taxation.
"The General Department of Taxation will encourage enterprises in the field of commercial gambling (casinos) to enter the tax registration and implement tax obligations properly in accordance with the laws and regulations on tax and gambling law," the statement said. Business.
Dr. Ky Sereywat, an economist at the Royal Academy of Cambodia, expressed support for a plan to boost the efficiency of tax collection on the casino sector, saying that the sector has a lot of revenue, but the efficiency of tax collection is still limited. Online casino.
Dr. Ky Sereyvath stated that it is good to have restrictions on enterprises in the field of commercial gambling (casino) to fulfill their tax obligations in accordance with the law, because this sector has a lot of revenue, which is tax revenue. Of the Royal Government to raise more capital for the development of other sectors.
Please be informed that the Law on the Management of Commercial Gambling will be promulgated by the end of 2020. The purpose of this law is to ensure the management of integrated trading and gambling centers to contribute to economic growth, promote tourism, create jobs, collect income, maintain security and social security.
