Samdech Techo Hun Sen cited as a practical example that with a vaccination rate of about 90% of the total population of 16 million as of January 20, 2022, Cambodia can control the spread and reduce hospitalization. Medical and mortality rates remain low and socio-economic activity can be maintained.
As a result, despite Cambodia experiencing the community event of 20 February 2021, which just ended on 20 December 2021, the recent success of the national vaccination campaign has boosted the Cambodian economy beyond expectations. .
Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia under the skillful leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has succeeded in the fight against Kovid 19, despite the challenges of the past to use measures to block. But Samdech Techo Hun Sen has used the strategy of vaccination against this deadly disease.
