(Kampong Chhnang): Mr. Hing Phop Menea, Deputy Governor of Kampong Chhnang City, said this morning, January 27, 2022, said that Mr. Sun You, Deputy Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, will apply for a permit to attack 13 flats in Phsar Chhnang Village, Phsar Chhnang Sangkat. Kampong Chhnang handed over the owners of the 13 flats so that the landlords could negotiate with the company themselves to demolish the stone house above to avoid collapsing, causing casualties.
