The topic of Mr. Kouch Chamroeun's talk was "How school management changes schools in the case of Sihanoukville." Through the lecture, which lasted for nearly 30 minutes, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun shared what his actual experience was done in the past in Sihanoukville on the field of education.
