The Ministry of Environment reformed the design, leadership and management of the Ministry, as well as its subordinate units, as well as developed policies, laws and regulations, such as strengthening the capacity of officials by all means and possibilities to participate in national affairs in response to the socio-economic situation in Cambodia. As well as regional and international facilities.
