The decision to adopt the Kovid 19 vaccine as a matter of urgency and priority is reflected in the careful and accurate assessment of the Kovid 19 epidemic. Royal Government of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Concerning the Kovid 19 vaccine, if we look back a little later, when the vaccine first appeared, we still remember the diplomatic war between vaccines made in China and vaccines made in the United States and Britain. The war led to a comparison between the quality of vaccines made in China and vaccines made in the United States and Britain, and Chinese vaccines have also been the target of attacks by free-spirited people.
This trend has even led some opposition politicians and NGOs in Cambodia to attack and criticize the decision of the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, to bring a vaccine made in China to the people.
The clearer the water, the brighter the sky, and the clearer the work on the fight against Kovid 19. So far, the Prime Minister's decision on a swift and unambiguous decision to bring the Chinese vaccine to the people has really saved Cambodia from the chaotic situation of Kovid 19.
Acceptance of vaccines made in China, which is considered a communist country, does not mean that Cambodia will give up vaccines made in liberal countries such as Britain and the United States. But in the early stages, when vaccines became a popular and competitive commodity, without the presence of Chinese vaccines, Cambodia would not have been able to achieve the desired results.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen once reminded that after liberating the country from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot, Samdech himself was painted in the most unjust way. In that, when Samdech went to meet with the free people, they called him a communist, when they met with the communists, they called him a free person. But the assessment that Samdech is a communist or a free man did not hinder the efforts for the nation and the people of Cambodia.
Samdech Techo once said that Samdech does not care about the assessment of what Samdech is, but what he is most clear about is that he is a Cambodian and does everything for Cambodia.
The painting of Samdech Techo as a communist dictator continues to this day from the mouths of opposition figures as well as some foreign politicians, although many stories have shown that Samdech Techo did not. Given the value of communism or liberalism, but what Samdech Techo focuses on is the result.
As a result of vaccinating the people, the political character of the Prime Minister Samdech Techo's leadership is becoming clearer. Samdech Techo did not assume that the vaccine came from a country that is considered communist or considered a free country, he welcomed with all joy as long as he could save Cambodia from the chaos of Kovid 19 and save the lives of the people. Citizens survived 19 outbreaks of Kovid.
This view is also a reflection of Cambodia's colorful politics, lively relations with the so-called communist country and the so-called free country to bring benefits to the nation and the people of Cambodia. 2022 Winter Olympics International community is paying more attention to China
The world looks forward to doubling the joy of the Chinese people in the New Year and the joy of the 2022 Winter Olympics. We already know that the health needs of the people are the core values of the daily practice of sports. Whether you are an athlete or a sports enthusiast or an avid exerciser, you can make good achievements based on respect for sports virtues and adherence to health principles.
Public health or good health is the aspiration of mankind and more than ever, sports have played an important role in the unity of the nation and together building the community of common destiny of mankind. All of this points to the fact that sports thrive only when sports are born out of health care and solidarity to humanity, which is a lesson of real life and walks in close proximity to time.
Athletes, sports enthusiasts, and athletes are always concerned about the personal well-being and public health of humankind and incorporate fun and well-being into their lives to strengthen their expectations and confidence for the future. Better, healthier, richer. The strength of sports lies in the will of humanity and the reflection of the collective community of humanity.
Sport is an abstract cultural symbol of humankind, each human being is full of emotions, dreams and struggles to promote the values of the sport, especially the values of the Olympics: excellence, friendship and respect, which is the foundation of The Olympic Movement in its activities to promote sports, culture and education and in order to build a better world.
It is undeniable that the three values of the Olympics are firmly respected and practiced by the people and China to promote the common values of humanity, especially the 2022 Winter Olympics. He added that this is a sports forum that has actively contributed to building a community of common destiny for humanity.
This is not the first time that the spirit of the Winter Olympics has been consistently practiced, as China hosted the Summer Olympics in August 2008 and received worldwide attention and admiration. As a whole, in 2022, the international community is paying more attention to China in the grand program of hosting the 2022 Winter Olympics.
Foreign Ministry Spokeswoman Jiang Yu's Regular Press Conference on March 20, 2013 Winter Olympics. At the same time, the voices of opposition are becoming more and more common to the politicization of sports.
This is a testament to the full confidence in the success of the Beijing Olympics and Winter Olympics, and the world has come to believe that China will become a strong country in the field of winter sports, as Beijing is the capital of China. The best safety of protection against Covid-19 disease.
Humanity's love for sports, especially the 2022 Olympics, marks the beginning of the Winter Olympics, not just a slogan, it shows China's practical action for this meaningful event. True and enduring love for the Olympics, including the Winter Olympics, is based on the creation and recognition of humanity as a participant in the creation and preservation of Olympic values.
It is clear that we need to emphasize this point, because some countries not only do not pay attention to the values of the Olympics, but those countries do not put their hearts into the values of the sport. The Olympics.
