According to a message from Bruno BODARD, Director General of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World, sent to the Royal Government of Cambodia, Mr. Bruno Boudard thanked the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, for Agree to host the World Convention of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World.
The Director General of the Beach Club expressed his strong hope that Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen will be honored to preside over the opening ceremony or event of the General Assembly scheduled for December 2022 in Sihanoukville. Connected with Darasakor Resort in Koh Kong Province.
Mr. Bruno Boudard stated that the General Assembly of the Most Beautiful Beach Club in the World will be a good opportunity to show the member countries of the Beach Club a unique example in the development of the coastal area achieved by Cambodia.
Speaking to Fresh News on January 25, 2022, Mr. Ny Phally, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism and Deputy Secretary General of the General Secretariat of the National Committee for Coastal Management and Development of Cambodia, said that according to his experience. Working with Mr. Bruno Boudard, Mr. Bruno is very appreciative of Cambodia, choosing Cambodia as the venue for this beach club convention is not a coincidence.
According to Mr. Ny Phally, Director General of the Beach Club, he is optimistic that through the experience of organizing the ASEAN Tourism Forum 2022 (ATF 2022) in January 2022, Cambodia is really capable enough to organize the General Meeting of the Beach Club, Cambodia. Well-organized health management, safety, order and hospitality in all aspects.
What is important is that Cambodia is a peaceful, developed country, especially the management of coastal areas, with good progress and prosperity going forward. On the other hand, in the 19th phase of the Kovid crisis, Cambodia has managed the country well, protected the well-being of the people and tourists to become a safe tourist destination in the world. This is according to the interest of Mr. Bruno Bodad, which was explained by Mr. Ny Phally.
Ny Phally confirmed that the convention of the most beautiful beach club in the world is held once a year, but due to the disruption of the global epidemic of Kovid 19, it was adjourned for two consecutive years. This year, therefore, the organization of the General Assembly in Cambodia at the end of this year is the beach club's first major event after a two-year hiatus.
